      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The camera device's auto-exposure routine is active and prioritizes the application-selected exposure time (android.sensor.exposureTime).</para>
          <para>The application has control over android.sensor.exposureTime while the application's values for android.sensor.sensitivity and android.sensor.frameDuration are ignored.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#CONTROL_AE_PRIORITY_MODE_SENSOR_EXPOSURE_TIME_PRIORITY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.CONTROL_AE_PRIORITY_MODE_SENSOR_EXPOSURE_TIME_PRIORITY</code>.</a></format></para>
